820f1b33-0559-4314-a852-1216bcd00aa4	151b7974-14e3-44fe-947d-fc93cd9031f8	2026-04-03 09:00:59.163548+00	This frequency-based scan analysis evaluated 434 conditions across 12 organ systems. Four organ systems were flagged at high risk levels: the Ultra Micro Scan category registered the highest concern with a score of 0.606, followed by the Respiratory System at 0.545, the Cardiovascular System at 0.530, and the Digestive System at 0.522. An additional 8 organ systems were identified at moderate risk. Among the top priority conditions identified, Osteoarthritis Deformans showed the highest individual condition score at 0.136 within the Osteoskeletal System, while Varix Dilatation scored 0.065 across the Digestive and Cardiovascular Systems. Hypothyroidism registered at 0.062 in the Endocrine System, Vegetative-Vascular Dystonia at 0.051 across the Digestive and Urogenital Systems, and Osteoporosis at 0.048 spanning the Digestive and Cardiovascular Systems.\n\nTemporal tracking of 105 conditions over prior sessions revealed a mixed pattern, with 36 conditions showing improvement, 35 worsening, 33 remaining stable, and 1 classified as volatile. Notable worsening trends were observed for Bronchial Asthma, Cardiac Arrhythmia, Colitis, Prostatitis, and Herpes Simplex Hepatitis. On the improving side, conditions such as Epidermoid Carcinoma of the Pancreas, Ascaris Lumbricoides, Enterobius Vermicularis, Nephroptosis, and Lactobacillus Acidophilus showed positive directional movement. Streptococcus Agalactiae was the sole condition flagged as volatile, indicating inconsistent readings across sessions.\n\nThese results are derived from frequency-based scan analysis and are intended for informational purposes only. They do not constitute a medical diagnosis or clinical recommendation. All findings, particularly those involving high-risk organ systems and worsening temporal trends, should be reviewed and discussed with a qualified healthcare professional who can provide appropriate clinical evaluation and guidance.	[{"organ_system": "11 ULTRA MICRO SCAN", "risk_tier": "high", "risk_score": 0.606, "condition_count": 7, "summary": "11 ULTRA MICRO SCAN shows high risk with 7 conditions detected. Primary concern: DYSKINESIA OF GALLBLADDER."}, {"organ_system": "03 RESPIRATORY SYSTEM", "risk_tier": "high", "risk_score": 0.545, "condition_count": 38, "summary": "03 RESPIRATORY SYSTEM shows high risk with 38 conditions detected. Primary concern: STREPTOCOCCUS AGALACTIAE."}, {"organ_system": "05 CARDIOVASCULAR SYSTEM", "risk_tier": "high", "risk_score": 0.53, "condition_count": 51, "summary": "05 CARDIOVASCULAR SYSTEM shows high risk with 51 conditions detected. Primary concern: STREPTOCOCCUS AGALACTIAE."}, {"organ_system": "02 DIGESTIVE SYSTEM", "risk_tier": "high", "risk_score": 0.522, "condition_count": 88, "summary": "02 DIGESTIVE SYSTEM shows high risk with 88 conditions detected. Primary concern: STREPTOCOCCUS AGALACTIAE."}, {"organ_system": "10 SENSORY SYSTEM", "risk_tier": "moderate", "risk_score": 0.498, "condition_count": 20, "summary": "10 SENSORY SYSTEM shows moderate risk with 20 conditions detected. Primary concern: STAPHYLOCOCCUS AUREUS."}, {"organ_system": "06 BLOOD AND LYMPH", "risk_tier": "moderate", "risk_score": 0.456, "condition_count": 46, "summary": "06 BLOOD AND LYMPH shows moderate risk with 46 conditions detected. Primary concern: STREPTOCOCCUS AGALACTIAE."}, {"organ_system": "12 DNA RNA", "risk_tier": "moderate", "risk_score": 0.452, "condition_count": 10, "summary": "12 DNA RNA shows moderate risk with 10 conditions detected. Primary concern: NEURASTHENIA."}, {"organ_system": "09 OSTEOSKELETAL SYSTEM", "risk_tier": "moderate", "risk_score": 0.452, "condition_count": 8, "summary": "09 OSTEOSKELETAL SYSTEM shows moderate risk with 8 conditions detected. Primary concern: OSTEOPOROSIS."}, {"organ_system": "07 ENDOCRINE SYSTEM", "risk_tier": "moderate", "risk_score": 0.451, "condition_count": 24, "summary": "07 ENDOCRINE SY